<title>JAPAN: Japan Food Agency to resume grain tender April 10.</title>
<headline>Japan Food Agency to resume grain tender April 10.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Food Agency said on Thursday that it did not carry out its weekly import tender for wheat and barley today and will resume the tender on April 10.</p>
<p>The agency, which is Japan's sole importer of wheat and barley, last week finished buying grains for fiscal 1996/97, an official of the agency said.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk (+81-3-3432-7391)</p>
